\begin{align*}
C + P - C\cap P &= 360 - 15 - 150 \\
C + P &= 135
\end{align*}
We also know that $C\cap C\cap P = 75$, so $C\cap P = 25$.  Since $C\cap P = 30$, we can set up the following equation:
\begin{align*}
