Then \begin{align*}
|1 + z| + |1 - z + z^2| &= |1 + e^{i\theta}| + |1 - e^{i\theta} + e^{2i\theta}| \\
&= |1 + \cos\theta + i\sin\theta| + |1 - \cos\theta + i\sin\theta| \\
&= \sqrt{1 + \cos\theta + \sin\theta} + \sqrt{1 - \cos\theta + \sin\theta}.
